#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""config-me: set up a fresh Ubuntu VM or WSL distro.

Interactive sections:
  1. Languages        (multi-select)  Node, C#/.NET, Java, Go, Python, Rust
  2. Container engine (single-select) Docker, Podman, containerd (+nerdctl)
  3. AI CLI tools     (multi-select)  Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, GitHub Copilot, Gemini

Run `config-me -h` for flags. Standard library only; needs Python 3.8+ and Ubuntu (apt).
"""

